===Pass through the Path of the Superstars to reach the Penacony Grand Theater{{subst:void|<!--103270501-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=SoulGlad™ Scorchsand Audition Venue|You successfully defeat the knight whose passion was like a burning flame, and claim your entry ticket to the "Path of the Superstar."<br />You will soon receive a personal reception from Miss Robin herself... No, you are already within reach of the Penacony Grand Theater and the Stellaron! Remember the famous words of Hamster Ball Knight: "Go, go, go, go!"}}
{{Dialogue Start}}


;(Unused &mdash; Perf)
:'''???:''' Congratulations to the both of you on becoming the Festive Superstars of this year's Charmony Festival. Before entering the Grand Theater...
::'''Sunday:''' I, on behalf of the organizers, extend my sincere congratulations to you, wishing you joy under THEIR radiance.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are you doing here?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You already worked things out with the Dreammaster?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} All I get are "sincere congratulations"? Where are my Stellar Jades?
:::All I get are "sincere congratulations"? Where are my Stellar Jades?
:::'''Sunday:''' *laughs* Your endeavors are worthy of extra recognition, and I've taken steps to ensure that. However, this reward is not a material one... but rather the opportunity for an open and honest communication between us.
::'''Sunday:''' As previously promised, my sister, Mr. Yang, and I have met with the Dreammaster. We delved into the truth about Penacony and its Stellaron, and have come to a consensus&mdash;
::'''Sunday:''' Both I and the Oak Family cannot acquiesce to your request.
::'''Firefly:''' ...Just as expected.
::'''Sunday:''' We acknowledge the perspective of you Nameless &mdash; Penacony does require change, but not as you propose. The Planet of Festivities cannot and will not revert to a place characterized by chaos, disorder, or anarchy.
::'''Sunday:''' Through your journey of overcoming obstacles, you must have glimpsed the essence of that era: The vulnerable ruthlessly eliminated, equality non-existent, commonfolk living precarious lives, eking out a dreary existence...
::'''Sunday:''' Ultimately, only "heroes" like yourselves manage to achieve success.
::'''Sunday:''' But I would dare ask: (Trailblazer), if you did not possess the special status of having a Stellaron, and you were but an anonymous and frail member among the masses... Which Penacony would you prefer?
::'''Sunday:''' A dystopia for the survival of the fittest, or a Sweetdream Paradise for all?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} There's nothing wrong with being the fittest...
:::There's nothing wrong with being the fittest...
:::A Sweetdream Paradise doesn't sound too bad...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A Sweetdream Paradise doesn't sound too bad...
:::A Sweetdream Paradise doesn't sound too bad...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't know. Why're you asking me?
:::I don't know. Why're you asking me?
:::'''March 7th:''' That's not the point! (Trailblazer), don't let him mislead you.
